# Blazemire Verge: its {R} ability is offered only while you control a Swamp or a Mountain (CR 602.5b). Alone it
# makes {B}; once a Swamp is in play (a Mountain would do as well) it makes {R}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Blazemire Verge
Swamp
Plains x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Blazemire Verge.Play
! Bot1.Battlefield.Blazemire Verge.Activate(Ability: {R})
Bot1.Battlefield.Blazemire Verge.Activate(Ability: {B})
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Blazemire Verge.Activate(Ability: {R})

